∧:R □[0s,∞) {"../Lex/example/GDPR/gdpr.lex:1009:1-1014:45"}{∀c. ∀ds. ∀rq. Request(ds, rq, c) ∧ ¬Exception49(c, ds, rq) →:R ¬UndueDelay(rq) U[0s,1M]:R (∃rs. RequestResponse(ds, rq, rs)) ∨:L RequestExtension(c, rq)}